4em 0.6em}.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable td,.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable th{border:0;padding:0}</style><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"border-spacing:3px; width:30em;\"><caption class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan\" title=\"Damallsvenskan\">Damallsvenskan</a></caption><tbody><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollss%C3%A4song\" title=\"Fotbollssäsong\">Säsong</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">2018</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Nya lag för säsongen</span></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4xj%C3%B6_DFF\" title=\"Växjö DFF\">Växjö DFF</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Kalmar\" title=\"IFK Kalmar\">IFK Kalmar</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Vinnare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pite%C3%A5_IF_Dam\" title=\"Piteå IF Dam\">Piteå IF</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Nedflyttade</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_DFF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hammarby IF DFF\">Hammarby IF</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Kalmar\" title=\"IFK Kalmar\">IFK Kalmar</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Women%27s_Champions_League_2019/2020\" title=\"Uefa Women&#39;s Champions League 2019/2020\">Champions League</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pite%C3%A5_IF_Dam\" title=\"Piteå IF Dam\">Piteå IF</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Kopparbergs/G%C3%B6teborg_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC\">Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Spelade&#160;matcher</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">132</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt&#160;antal&#160;mål</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">412 (3,1 per match)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Bästa målgörare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Anja_Mittag\" title=\"Anja Mittag\">Anja Mittag</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a> (17 mål)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a> 10-0 <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Kalmar\" title=\"IFK Kalmar\">IFK Kalmar</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(18 augusti 2018)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Kalmar\" title=\"IFK Kalmar\">IFK Kalmar</a> 1-9 <a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköpings FC</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(22 september 2018)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Åskådarantal i snitt</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">895</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"\"><div style=\"float: left;\">&#8592; <a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan_2017\" title=\"Damallsvenskan 2017\">2017</a> </div><div style=\"float: right;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan_2019\" title=\"Damallsvenskan 2019\">2019</a> &#8594;</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Damallsvenskan 2018</b> var <a href=\"/wiki/Sverige\" title=\"Sverige\">Sveriges</a> högsta division i fotboll för damer under säsongen 2018 och spelades under perioden <a href=\"/wiki/14_april\" title=\"14 april\">14 april</a> – <a href=\"/wiki/27_oktober\" title=\"27 oktober\">27 oktober</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sport%C3%A5ret_2018\" title=\"Sportåret 2018\">2018</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Nykomlingar i serien är <a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4xj%C3%B6_DFF\" title=\"Växjö DFF\">Växjö DFF</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Kalmar\" title=\"IFK Kalmar\">IFK Kalmar</a>, som båda aldrig tidigare har spelat i <a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan\" title=\"Damallsvenskan\">Damallsvenskan</a>.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Pite%C3%A5_IF_Dam\" title=\"Piteå IF Dam\">Piteå IF</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> vann serien för första gången i klubbens historia, följda av <a href=\"/wiki/Kopparbergs/G%C3%B6teborg_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC\">Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a> på andra- och tredjeplats. <a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_DFF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hammarby IF DFF\">Hammarby IF</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Kalmar\" title=\"IFK Kalmar\">IFK Kalmar</a> kom på elfte- och tolfteplats, och spelar därmed i <a href=\"/wiki/Elitettan\" title=\"Elitettan\">Elitettan</a> under <a href=\"/wiki/Elitettan_2019\" title=\"Elitettan 2019\">2019</a>. De ersätts med <a href=\"/wiki/Kungsbacka_DFF\" title=\"Kungsbacka DFF\">Kungsbacka DFF</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/KIF_%C3%96rebro_DFF\" title=\"KIF Örebro DFF\">KIF Örebro</a> som kom etta respektive tvåa i <a href=\"/wiki/Elitettan_2018\" title=\"Elitettan 2018\">Elitettan 2018</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Tabeller\">Tabeller</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2018&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Tabeller\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2018&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Tabeller\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Poängtabell\"><span id=\"Po.C3.A4ngtabell\"></span>Poängtabell</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2018&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Poängtabell\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2018&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Poängtabell\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"infobox wikitable\" style=\"font-size:85%;width:22em;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ffec8b;\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Mästare samt kvalificerad för <a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Women%27s_Champions_League_2019/2020\" title=\"Uefa Women&#39;s Champions League 2019/2020\">Champions League 2019/2020</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#c3c3dc;\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Kvalificerad för <a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Women%27s_Champions_League_2019/2020\" title=\"Uefa Women&#39;s Champions League 2019/2020\">Champions League 2019/2020</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Nedflyttning till <a href=\"/wiki/Elitettan_2019\" title=\"Elitettan 2019\">Elitettan 2019</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&#160;<span class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; ;\">Denna tabell:&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Damallsvenskan_2018\" title=\"Mall:Poängtabell för Damallsvenskan 2018\"><span title=\"Visa denna mall\" style=\";\">visa</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Damallsvenskan_2018&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Damallsvenskan_2018&amp;action=edit\"><span style=\";\" title=\"Redigera den här mallen\">redigera</span></a></span>&#160;\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"font-size:0.9375em;line-height:1.4em;text-align:center;background:white;margin-top:0.1em;\">\n<tbody><tr><th style=\"width:1.8em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Placering\">Nr</span> </th>\n<th style=\"width: 13em;\"> Lag </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Spelade matcher\">S</span></th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Vinster\">V</span>        </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Oavgjorda\">O</span>      </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Förluster\">F</span>      </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Gjorda mål\">GM</span>    </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Insläppta mål\">IM</span> </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Målskillnad\">MS</span>   </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Poäng\">P</span>          </th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffec8b; border-bottom:2px solid gray;\"> <td>1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pite%C3%A5_IF_Dam\" title=\"Piteå IF Dam\">Piteå IF</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 16 </td>\n<td> 0  </td>\n<td> 6  </td>\n<td> 42 </td>\n<td> 24 </td>\n<td>+18</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">48</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#c3c3dc; border-bottom:2px solid grey;\"> <td>2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kopparbergs/G%C3%B6teborg_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC\">Kopparbergs/Göteborg</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 15 </td>\n<td> 2  </td>\n<td> 5  </td>\n<td> 54 </td>\n<td> 27 </td>\n<td>+27</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">47</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>3</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 14 </td>\n<td> 3  </td>\n<td> 5  </td>\n<td> 55 </td>\n<td> 18 </td>\n<td>+37</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">45</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>4</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kristianstads_DFF\" title=\"Kristianstads DFF\">Kristianstads DFF</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 11 </td>\n<td> 6  </td>\n<td> 5  </td>\n<td> 30 </td>\n<td> 26 </td>\n<td>+4</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">39</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>5</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköpings FC</a> <span style=\"cursor:help;color:dimgrey;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:bold;\" title=\"Regerande mästare\">(RM)</span>   </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 9  </td>\n<td> 6  </td>\n<td> 7  </td>\n<td> 47 </td>\n<td> 31 </td>\n<td>+16</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">33</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>6</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna_United_DFF\" title=\"Eskilstuna United DFF\">Eskilstuna United</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 9  </td>\n<td> 4  </td>\n<td> 9  </td>\n<td> 30 </td>\n<td> 36 </td>\n<td>−6</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">31</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>7</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4xj%C3%B6_DFF\" title=\"Växjö DFF\">Växjö DFF</a> <span style=\"cursor:help;color:dimgrey;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:bold;\" title=\"Uppflyttad från föregående säsong\">(U)</span>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 9  </td>\n<td> 2  </td>\n<td> 11 </td>\n<td> 29 </td>\n<td> 33 </td>\n<td>−4</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">29</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>8</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Dam\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Dam\">Djurgårdens IF</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 7  </td>\n<td> 6  </td>\n<td> 9  </td>\n<td> 25 </td>\n<td> 30 </td>\n<td>−5</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">27</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>9</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vittsj%C3%B6_GIK\" title=\"Vittsjö GIK\">Vittsjö GIK</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 7  </td>\n<td> 5  </td>\n<td> 10 </td>\n<td> 32 </td>\n<td> 26 </td>\n<td>+6</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">26</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white; border-bottom:2px solid red;\"> <td>10</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Limhamn_Bunkeflo_(damer)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IF Limhamn Bunkeflo (damer)\">Limhamn Bunkeflo</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 8  </td>\n<td> 2  </td>\n<td> 12 </td>\n<td> 25 </td>\n<td> 40 </td>\n<td>−15</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">26</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>11</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_DFF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hammarby IF DFF\">Hammarby IF</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 8  </td>\n<td> 0  </td>\n<td> 14 </td>\n<td> 29 </td>\n<td> 39 </td>\n<td>−10</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">24</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>12</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Kalmar\" title=\"IFK 